Package: sequencemap
Title: Spatial Mapping of Viral Sequence Variation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "First",
           family = "Last",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "first.last@example.com")
Description: Tools for converting aligned viral sequence data and sampling
    coordinates into ordination-based spatial summaries and predicted surfaces.
    The PCA-first workflow supports alignment quality control, location-level
    score and dispersion summaries, and optional Gaussian SPDE interpolation
    through 'INLA'.
